Package: pocketforge-open-gpu-stack
Version: 1
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: PocketForge OS <os@pocketforge.invalid>
Provides: libegl-mesa0, libegl-vendor, libglx-mesa0, libglx-vendor
Conflicts: libegl-mesa0, libgl1-mesa-dri, libglx-mesa0, mesa-opencl-icd, mesa-va-drivers, mesa-vdpau-drivers, mesa-vulkan-drivers
Description: dependency contract for the PocketForge open GPU stack
 This metadata-only package lets generic Debian graphics clients depend on the
 GLVND EGL and GLX vendor interfaces without installing Debian Mesa drivers.
 The actual EGL, GLES, GBM, Zink, and PowerVR Vulkan implementation is the
 source-built gpu-um-tsp tree installed under /usr/local by the image builder.
